Where to place the getter? Near `_extractResponse` or in the lifecycle section. I'll put it right after `_runLifecycle` or near `_extractResponse` since it mirrors the strict-mode logic in `_extractResponse`. Actually — note that `_extractResponse`'s first branch is exactly `params.requireCliOutputFile && !result.hasOutputResponse`. The skip guard uses the same condition. I could even implement the check on the response text, but using `_cliResult` directly is cleaner.

